{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1cdUGvrffTo3zy4Xti","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: build the normalisation fix now and skip the pre-change survey.**\n\n**Why**\n- Two independent sources already agree. Search logs show 18% of searches return nothing, and most of the top 200 zero-result terms are part numbers with or without dashes or spaces. Sales logs show about 340 \"can't find part online\" calls a month. That is behavioural evidence, which is stronger than satisfaction answers.\n- A survey would measure sentiment, not cause. It would delay a three-day, easily reversible change by weeks. It would also suffer from low response rates and from only reaching customers who still use the site.\n- The cost of being wrong is small. If the fix doesn't help, you've lost three days.\n\n**Caveats to check first (log review only)**\n- Some zero-result terms may be parts you don't stock. Normalisation won't fix those, so 18% is an upper bound.\n- Sample about 30 of the tagged calls to confirm they're mostly part-number misses.\n- Keep exact matches ranked first. Normalisation can create false matches between similar part numbers, which is costly with industrial parts.\n- Consider a \"did you mean\" or \"not stocked\" message for the remaining zero-result searches.\n\n**Measure instead**\nRecord these baselines before shipping, then compare after two to four weeks:\n- Zero-result rate on part-number-shaped queries.\n- Search-to-basket rate.\n- Monthly \"can't find part\" calls.\n\n**Where the head of sales has a point**\nA short survey or call-tag review after the fix is reasonable. It can show what remains broken, such as descriptions, cross-references or stock gaps. Offer that as phase two, so it informs the next change rather than blocking this one."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3450,"cache_read_input_tokens":5035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3450},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc6a66c9-9f7e-4d17-a5ec-512dfecda398","uuid":"bc6f9e0e-139e-4831-8e22-787259321ea5","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:14:31.286Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1cdDeP1XstTx8qigwt"}
